OL,3,GNEWSADad-of-four fatally stabbed in
OL,4,Acaravan - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-four died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed in a caravan, an inquest
OL,8,Fopening has been told.
OL,10,FLee Jackson, 40, was found dead at the
OL,11,FValley Farm Holiday Park,
OL,12,FClacton-on-Sea, Essex, on 14 October.
OL,14,FMoments before the discovery, a man had
OL,15,Fbeen seen leaving the caravan "with
OL,16,Fblood on his hands", Essex Coroner's
OL,17,FCourt heard.
OL,19,FDaniel Fox, 39, of Hampden Crescent,
OL,20,FWarley, has been charged with murdering
OL,21,FJackson and is due before Chelmsford
OL,22,FCrown Court on 16 December.
